                  <div>
                    <p class="section-kicker">Getting Started</p>
                    <h2 id="section-4-title" class="section-title">Account Registration</h2>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="section-body">
                  <p>To access certain features, you must create an Account and provide accurate, current, and complete information during onboarding and throughout your use of the Services.</p>

                  <h3 class="subsection-title">Registration Information</h3>
                  <ul>
                    <li>Provide truthful identity, contact, and business information.</li>
                    <li>Keep your registration details updated whenever circumstances change.</li>
                    <li>Provide beneficial ownership or business control details when requested.</li>
                    <li>Submit supporting records for verification, risk review, or compliance checks.</li>
                  </ul>

                  <h3 class="subsection-title">Security Obligations</h3>
                  <p>You are responsible for protecting your credentials, API keys, access tokens, and authentication devices. You must promptly notify ZenoPay if you suspect unauthorized activity, compromised access, or security weaknesses affecting your Account.</p>

                  <h3 class="subsection-title">Verification and Review</h3>
                  <p>ZenoPay may conduct identity verification, business due diligence, sanctions screening, fraud review, and ongoing risk monitoring before or after activation. We may decline, delay, or restrict an Account until required checks are completed.</p>
                </div>
              </section>

              <section id="section-5" class="terms-section" aria-labelledby="section-5-title">
