                  <span class="section-number">7</span>
                  <div>
                    <p class="section-kicker">Commercial Terms</p>
                    <h2 id="section-7-title" class="section-title">Fees &amp; Charges</h2>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="section-body">
                  <p>Your use of the Services may be subject to fees, including transaction fees, payout fees, chargeback fees, currency conversion fees, subscription charges, platform fees, implementation fees, or custom enterprise pricing.</p>

                  <ul>
                    <li>Fees may be disclosed in your dashboard, pricing page, contract, or merchant schedule.</li>
                    <li>Fees may be deducted directly from balances, settlements, or payout amounts.</li>
                    <li>You remain responsible for taxes, levies, and duties associated with your use of the Services.</li>
                    <li>ZenoPay may revise fees with notice where permitted by Applicable Law or contract.</li>
                  </ul>

                  <div class="callout-box warning-callout">
                    <i class="fas fa-file-invoice-dollar callout-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    <div class="callout-content">
                      <strong>Chargeback Costs</strong>
                      Disputed or reversed transactions may give rise to additional network, administrative, and recovery costs, which may be assessed to your Account as permitted by your pricing terms.
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </section>

              <section id="section-8" class="terms-section" aria-labelledby="section-8-title">
