                    <h2 id="section-8-title" class="section-title">Privacy &amp; Data Protection</h2>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="section-body">
                  <p>Your privacy matters to us. Our collection, use, storage, transfer, and protection of personal data are governed by our Privacy Policy and relevant data protection laws.</p>

                  <h3 class="subsection-title">How Data Is Used</h3>
                  <p>ZenoPay may use personal and transaction data to provide the Services, prevent fraud, perform verification, support analytics, comply with legal obligations, improve product performance, and communicate operational notices.</p>

                  <h3 class="subsection-title">Security Measures</h3>
                  <p>We use layered administrative, technical, and organizational safeguards, which may include encryption, access control, monitoring, logging, rate limits, credential rotation, and network segmentation.</p>

                  <div class="callout-box info-callout">
                    <i class="fas fa-lock callout-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    <div class="callout-content">
                      <strong>Shared Responsibility</strong>
                      ZenoPay secures the platform infrastructure, but you remain responsible for securing your endpoints, application integrations, customer notices, permissions, and internal access controls.
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </section>

              <section id="section-9" class="terms-section" aria-labelledby="section-9-title">
