                    <li>Money laundering, sanctions evasion, terrorist financing, or facilitation of illegal trade.</li>
                    <li>Use of the Services for prohibited goods, restricted industries, or unauthorized high-risk activity.</li>
                    <li>Reverse engineering, scraping, or attempting unauthorized system access.</li>
                    <li>Uploading malware, interfering with service integrity, or circumventing limits or safeguards.</li>
                  </ul>

                  <div class="callout-box warning-callout">
                    <i class="fas fa-ban callout-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    <div class="callout-content">
                      <strong>Enforcement</strong>
                      ZenoPay may immediately suspend processing, freeze balances where permitted, or terminate access if we reasonably believe your use of the Services violates these Terms or creates risk to others.
                    </div>
