                  <h3 class="subsection-title">Limited License</h3>
                  <p>Subject to compliance with these Terms, ZenoPay grants you a limited, revocable, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to access and use the Services solely for their intended purpose.</p>

                  <h3 class="subsection-title">Restrictions</h3>
                  <ul>
                    <li>You may not copy, modify, resell, sublicense, or distribute the Services except as expressly permitted.</li>
                    <li>You may not remove proprietary notices or present ZenoPay branding as your own.</li>
                    <li>You may not use our marks without prior written consent.</li>
