                    <h2 id="section-13-title" class="section-title">Account Termination &amp; Suspension</h2>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="section-body">
                  <p>You may stop using the Services at any time, subject to any outstanding contractual, operational, or settlement obligations. ZenoPay may suspend or terminate all or part of the Services where necessary to manage security, legal, reputational, or financial risk.</p>

                  <ul>
                    <li>We may suspend access during investigations, risk reviews, or suspected misuse.</li>
                    <li>Termination does not eliminate payment obligations, dispute exposure, or compliance retention duties.</li>
                    <li>ZenoPay may retain transaction records and required data for audit, legal, tax, or compliance purposes.</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </section>

              <section id="section-14" class="terms-section" aria-labelledby="section-14-title">
                <div class="section-header">
                  <span class="section-number">14</span>
