                    <h2 id="section-14-title" class="section-title">Changes to Terms</h2>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="section-body">
                  <p>ZenoPay may update these Terms periodically to reflect product changes, legal developments, market practices, or security enhancements. When material changes are made, we may provide notice by posting updated Terms, updating the effective date, or issuing communications through the dashboard, email, or other reasonable channels.</p>
                  <p>Your continued use of the Services after the effective date of revised Terms constitutes acceptance of those changes unless Applicable Law requires a different form of consent.</p>
                </div>
              </section>

              <section id="section-15" class="terms-section" aria-labelledby="section-15-title">
