                    <h2 id="section-15-title" class="section-title">Contact Information</h2>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="section-body">
                  <p>If you have questions about these Terms, need clarification regarding your obligations, or wish to raise a formal concern, please contact the appropriate team below.</p>

                  <div class="contact-grid">
                    <article class="contact-card">
                      <i class="fas fa-envelope contact-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                      <h3>Legal Inquiries</h3>
                      <p>legal@zenopay.com</p>
